#~ "Essas causam o arquivo de PID e o soquete do barramento de sistema estarem "
#~ "em <filename class=\"directory\">/run</filename>, em vez do obsoleto "
#~ "<filename class=\"directory\">/var/run</filename>."

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "This ensures the D-Bus per-user service and socket unit files are installed "
#~ "for Systemd.  They are not useful (but harmless) in a base LFS installation,"
#~ " however they can be used once systemd is rebuilt with PAM support in BLFS."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Isso garante que o serviço \"D-Bus\" por usuário(a) e os arquivos de unidade"
